        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Abineri mwana wa-Neri, silutwe wampi ya-Saulo wakabweza Isibosete mwana wa-Saulo, wamuleta ku-Mahanaimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamu bika kuti abe mwami wa-Gileadi awa-Asuri awa-Jezreeli awa-Efraimu awa-Benjamini awaba-Israyeli boonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyu Isibosete wakali amyaaka iili makumi one naakataanguna kuba abwami bwa-Israyeli, nkabela wakeendelezya myaaka yobile. Pele mukowa wa-Juda wakatobela Davida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mweelwe waciindi Davida ncaakali mwami wamukowa wa-Juda mu-Hebroni kuuli myaaka iili musanu aibili amyeezi iili musanu aumwi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
