        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joabu wakalizya mweembo, nkabela bantu boonse bakaima, teebakacili kubatanda limbi ba-Israyeli, taakwe nibakacili kulwana limbi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.28",
