        {
          "text": "Lino bakabweza Asaheli, bakaakumuzika mumavwiko aabawisi mu-Betelehemu. Nkabela joabu abantu bakwe bakeenda masiku oonse, elyo nibwakaca cifumofumo bakasika ku-Hebroni.",
